  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">The Guild of Harwich Artists</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3820 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-paint-the-town tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-wet-sale tag-wychmere-harbor\" id=\"post-3820\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Annual Paint The Town, Saturday June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-12T01:53:26-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 12, 2018, 1:53 am\">June 12, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Annual “Paint The Town” en plein air event will be held Saturday, June 16 from 9:00 am – noon. Watch for Guild of Harwich Artists in the following locations: Harwich <a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3741 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-news tag-artweekma tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3741\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A group of people playing music.\" src=\"/media/archive/8dc63b26c7b4a7f866cf24d2fb46053b9dae5dd33b8fc2c612bb40d8b35e92e0.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Members Play for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-26T11:22:23-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 26, 2018, 11:22 am\">April 26, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Saturday morning, April 28th, Guild members Carroll Sivco and Elaine Felos Ostrander are members of the Cape Cod Ukulele Club will be performing at 11 Am in the new Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-members-play-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3724 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-harwich-ma tag-larry-folding tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-watercolor\" id=\"post-3724\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/watercolor-classes-with-larry-folding-begin-may-1/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Watercolor Classes with Larry Folding Begin May 1</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-25T00:41:10-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 25, 2018, 12:41 am\">April 25, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists member, Larry Folding will hold Watercolor Classes at the Harwich Cultural Center Tuesdays beginning May 1st thru June 19th from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM. Classes <a href=\"/news/watercolor-classes-with-larry-folding-begin-may-1/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3651 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-artweek tag-doris-mee tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3651\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"373\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a woman wearing a black and white hat.\" src=\"/media/archive/17ba029536948e62bf6a0907464342d5f36869dc57b5336b7278ea8365129815.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\" rel=\"bookmark\">ArtWeek Demonstrator, Doris Mee</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-03-29T19:21:45-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, March 29, 2018, 7:21 pm\">March 29, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists, as part of the upcoming ArtWeek festival happening April 27 – May 6, presents a Meet the Artist demonstration featuring master <a href=\"/news/artweek-demonstrator-doris-mee/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3533 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-annual-ornament-fundraiser tag-cape-cod tag-christmas-in-harwich tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-childrens-fund tag-harwich-ma tag-the-childrens-center tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3533\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"402\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three woman and a cheque\" src=\"/media/archive/5aaa89ed4b76470d775ac1096a3ba906daf2de3810417c82b495b1ab8f8d7014.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Local Organizations Benefit from Annual Fundraiser</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-29T20:50:39-05:00\" title=\"Monday, January 29, 2018, 8:50 pm\">January 29, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ Annual Ornament Fundraiser held during the Harwich Christmas Stroll and on the following weekends at the Art Gallery, was a huge success. Total proceeds after <a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<span class=\"page-numbers dots\">…</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>4</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
